  "referenceNumber": "RUS2210",
  "remarks": "\nBEGEY (IMO 8943210) is involved in activity whose object or effect is to destabilise Ukraine or undermine or threaten the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine or to obtain a benefit from or support the Government of Russia. Namely, BEGEY is involved in carrying military goods from a third country to a place in Russia.   \n",
